-- Rifts World Book 33: Northern Gun One, four robots (printed 154-166): Multibot NG-M56, Megabot NG-M57-2N1, Ogre EXC-17, Okemos Explorer
-- 4 vehicle rows, with 71 locations and 19 weapon entries.
