  ('ng-m57-2n1-megabot', 'Combat Racer: Passenger Compartment Window Plates (4; with cameras)', 50, 'Each. Very small target: Called Shot, -4 to strike (-6 when the racer is moving over 60 mph/96 km). Slides over the window in combat.', 15),
